Editor: Luiz Olavo Bonino da Silva Santos, UTwente, https://www.utwente.nl/en/eemcs/scs/
Editor: Dennis van Gerwen, LUMC, https://www.lumc.nl/
Editor: Kees Burger, Health-RI, https://www.health-ri.nl/
Former Editor: Rajaram Kaliyaperumal, LUMC, https://www.lumc.nl/
Abstract: This document specifies the FAIR Data Point (FDP), a metadata service that exposes machine-actionable metadata following the FAIR principles.
  The document defines the FDP metadata model and the FDP capabilities — Read, Navigate, Write and Bundle — together with the conformance criteria that an application can claim for each of these capabilities.
  An application is a FAIR Data Point if it conforms to the Core conformance class, which comprises the Read and Navigate capabilities.
Canonical URL: https://specs.fairdatapoint.org/
